sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Cliente
    participant API as "erp-api<br/>CommandProductControllerV1<br/>(vars: createProductCommand:CreateProductCommand, updateProductCommand:UpdateProductCommand, updateStockCommand:UpdateStockCommand, id:String)"
    participant App as "erp-application<br/>CreateProductUseCase.execute(CreateProductCommand)<br/>UpdateProductUseCase.execute(UpdateProductCommand)<br/>UpdateStockUseCase.execute(UpdateStockCommand)<br/>DeactivateProductUseCase.execute(DeactivateProductCommand)"
    participant Domain as "erp-domain<br/>ProductRoot extends AggregateRoot<ProductId> -> Entity<ProductId]<br/>ValueObjects: SKU, ProductName, Stock, CategoryReference, ProductImage, Money"
    participant Infra as "erp-infrastructure<br/>ProductRepository / ImageStorageService / ProductCatalogRepositoryPort"
    participant Common as "erp-common<br/>Commands/DTOs: CreateProductCommand, UpdateProductCommand, UpdateStockCommand, DeactivateProductCommand"

    Note over Client,API: Crear producto (multipart/form-data)
    Client->>API: POST /commands/products (CreateProductCommand + image data)
    API->>Common: mapear y validar CreateProductCommand (record)
    API->>App: CreateProductUseCase.execute(command)
    App->>Domain: ProductRoot.create(sku, name, description, price, stock, category, image, createdBy)
    Note over Domain: ProductRoot (AggregateRoot) instancia ProductImage (value object)
    Domain->>Infra: ProductRepository.save(productRoot)
    Infra-->>Domain: persisted ProductId
    Domain-->>App: productRoot with id
    App-->>API: returns productId
    API-->>Client: 201 Created Location: /commands/products/{id}

    Note over Client,API: Actualizar producto
    Client->>API: PUT /commands/products/{id} (UpdateProductCommand + optional image)
    API->>App: UpdateProductUseCase.execute(updateCommand)
    App->>Infra: ProductRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: productRoot
    App->>Domain: productRoot.update(name, description, price, category, image)
    Domain->>Infra: ProductRepository.save(productRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content

    Note over Client,API: Actualizar stock
    Client->>API: PATCH /commands/products/{id}/stock { UpdateStockCommand }
    API->>App: UpdateStockUseCase.execute(updateStockCommand)
    App->>Infra: ProductRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: productRoot
    App->>Domain: if command.isIncrement() -> productRoot.incrementStock(qty, reason) else productRoot.decrementStock(abs(qty), reason)
    Domain->>Infra: ProductRepository.save(productRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content

    Note over Client,API: Desactivar producto
    Client->>API: PATCH /commands/products/{id}/deactivate
    API->>App: DeactivateProductUseCase.execute(new DeactivateProductCommand(id))
    App->>Infra: ProductRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: productRoot
    App->>Domain: productRoot.deactivate() // register ProductDeactivated event
    Domain->>Infra: ProductRepository.save(productRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content
